<title>SPAIN: Santander details H1 results by business.</title>
<headline>Santander details H1 results by business.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish banking group Santander</p>
<p>on Tuesday gave the following breakdown of its first half</p>
<p>attributable net income according to business area:</p>
<p>(In billions of pesetas unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>Loss on corporate activities  9.56  13.88</p>
<p> Retail banking		   50.45  38.91</p>
<p> Spain				21.95  22.61</p>
<p> Banesto			     8.40   7.67</p>
<p> Retail banking abroad	  20.10   8.64</p>
<p> Wholesale banking		18.89  20.88</p>
<p> Santander Investment	    7.94   6.00</p>
<p>Corp.banking, Treasury</p>
<p> and Capital Markets	    10.95  14.88</p>
<p>Consolidated group		59.78  45.90</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom + 34 1 585 2161</p>
</text>
